## What this does

Every two weeks, a script pulls your GA4 engagement metrics via the GA4 Data API, reformats them, and writes them into a Google Sheet tab structured for your exec deck. A time-based trigger fires it automatically.

---

## Step 1 — Set up your Google Sheet

Create a sheet with two tabs:
- **`Raw Data`** — where the script writes GA4 output
- **`Exec Summary`** — formatted view for the deck

---

